  "analytical_usefulness": 0.68,
  "source_groundedness": 0.78,
  "rationale": "The set offers several genuinely useful new axes (improvement_mechanism, timeline_clarity, scope_breadth) that help identify goals worth attention. A couple of columns are weak: targeted_improvement_scope largely restates the outcome domain/category, and financial_impact_quantified is a bare flag applied inconsistently. Most values are sound readings of the descriptions with appropriate NULLs, but the boolean and complexity columns show some ungrounded/inconsistent assignments."
